INSERT INTO characters (character_id, anime_id, name, description, age, gender, image_url, birthday, blood_type, voice_actor, height, anilist_id, role, favourites) VALUES ('CH015995', 'AN1647', '片桐早苗', 'Hometown: Niigata Prefecture, Japan  Sanae is a former police officer who quit the force to become an idol, largely because the Producer convinced her. She is very flirtatious with the Producer and uses a lot of police terminology when talking, with her cards often referencing that she wants to put the Producer in handcuffs, lock him up, and do an interrogation as a teasing double entendre. She wishes to be seen by other idols as an older sister and be called Onee-sama, despite the fact that she', 28, '女性', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b129283-WAszYgvUDDm6.png', '3月7日', 'O', '和氣あず未', 152, 129283, 'SUPPORTING', 17) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO characters (character_id, anime_id, name, description, age, gender, image_url, birthday, blood_type, voice_actor, height, anilist_id, role, favourites) VALUES ('CH015996', 'AN1647', '渋谷凛', 'Hometown: Tokyo, Japan  Rin tends to be the “straight man” in joke sequences, and is sometimes overly serious to a comedic point. While she tends to be cool and harsh, she does have a sweet side that she occasionally shows others. She is self-conscious that her default expression comes off as unfriendly. Her cool, level headed demeanor is put to the test when she''s stuck in the same room as Ranko Kanzaki, Kaede Takagaki and Riina Tada.', 15, '女性', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b71273-zXfBpQK9zQko.png', '8月10日', 'B', '福原綾香', 165, 71273, 'SUPPORTING', 228) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO characters (character_id, anime_id, name, description, age, gender, image_url, birthday, blood_type, voice_actor, height, anilist_id, role, favourites) VALUES ('CH015997', 'AN1647', '一ノ瀬志希', 'Hometown: Iwate Prefecture, Japan  Shiki is a curious 18 y.o. girl who can be described only as "a mad scientist". She loves experiments, and is motivated by finding new things to hold her attention; if it''s not interesting, she''s not interested. Rather than being scouted by Producer, she chose him as part of one of her experiments. She sniffed the Producer and his smell convinced her that he was the right one for the experiment. She became an idol for this reason.  It''s implied she uses pheromo', 18, '女性', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b127072-pySx6bJuzOzn.jpg', '5月30日', NULL, '藍原ことみ', 161, 127072, 'SUPPORTING', 147) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO characters (character_id, anime_id, name, description, age, gender, image_url, birthday, blood_type, voice_actor, height, anilist_id, role, favourites) VALUES ('CH015998', 'AN1647', '速水奏', 'Hometown: Tokyo, Japan  Kanade is a mysterious and flirty girl who often teases the Producer. Due to her demeanor, It''s very hard to tell what she''s thinking, or if she''s joking around. Though she seems to be a very open person at first glance, she likes to remain distant which can be seen through her elusive lines in-game.  Kanade takes work as a serious effort and carries herself with pride. Although being prideful, she doesn''t let it stop her from being considerate and listening to others'' po', 17, '女性', 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b120269-ypcrCfOKefJo.png', '7月1日', 'O', '飯田友子', 162, 120269, 'SUPPORTING', 39) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
